class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-a2cb58d elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"a2cb58d\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img fetchpriority=\"high\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-detail1_syy-1.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3797\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-detail1_syy-1.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-detail1_syy-1-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-detail1_syy-1-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-detail1_syy-1-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-b960a69 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"b960a69\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-detail2_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3798\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-detail2_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-detail2_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-detail2_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Polyester-Filter-Bag-02-detail2_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-0119251 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"0119251\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>Specification of Polyester Filter Bags<\/h3><table width=\"716\"><tbody><tr><td width=\"72\">Heat resistance\u2103\/\u2109<\/td><td width=\"72\">up to 130\/266<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Fabric<\/td><td>100% polyester<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Length &amp; diameter<\/td><td>No limited<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Area weight (g\/m2)<\/td><td>350~650<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>Working lifetime<\/td><td>8000 hours and more<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>MOQ<\/td><td>50pcs<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Physical properties<\/h3><table><tbody><tr><td rowspan=\"2\">Air permeability(L\/m2.s) @200pa<\/td><td colspan=\"2\">Tensile strength(N\/5cm)<\/td><td colspan=\"2\">Temperature(\u2103\/\u2109)<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>warp<\/td><td>weft<\/td><td>continue<\/td><td>instant<\/td><\/tr><tr><td>200~300<\/td><td>1300<\/td><td>1500<\/td><td>130\/266<\/td><td>150\/302<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Chemical properties<\/h3><table><tbody><tr><td>Acid Resistance<\/td><td>Alkali Resistance<\/td><td>Hydrolytic Resistance<\/td><td>Oxidation Resistance<\/td><td>Abrasion resistance<\/td><\/tr><tr><td><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\">Moderate<\/span><\/td><td><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\">Moderate<\/span><\/td><td><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\">Poor<\/span><\/td><td><span lang=\"EN-US\" xml:lang=\"EN-US\">Good<\/span><\/td><td>Excellent<\/td><\/tr><\/tbody><\/table><h3>Working Principle<\/h3><p>The working principle of the polyester filter bag is the so-called \u201cdepth filtration\u201d technology, that is, the \u201cprimary dust layer\u201d (powder filter cake) is formed on the surface through the capture of the filter material fibers, and then the subsequent dust is filtered out through the powder filter cake. During the initial use of the polyester filter bag, due to its own large gap, some dust will be discharged through the filter material. Only when the powder cake is formed can the filtration process actually begin. After continuous use, the dust on the surface of the polyester filter bag will gradually penetrate into the filter material, causing the pores of the filter material to be blocked, increasing the running resistance of the equipment until the filter material must be replaced.<\/p><h3>In The Non-Woven Category, PET(Polyester) Needle Punched Non-Woven Material Has The Following Characteristics:<\/h3><ul><li><strong>High Filtration Efficiency<\/strong>: Polyester filter bags can efficiently capture fine dust, particles, and contaminants due to their dense fiber structure.<\/li><li><strong>Durability and Strength<\/strong>: Polyester fibers are strong and resistant to tearing and abrasion, which extends the lifespan of the filter bags.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Resistance<\/strong>: Polyester fibers exhibit good resistance to many acids and alkalis, making them suitable for use in harsh chemical environments.<\/li><li><strong>Solvent Resistance<\/strong>: Polyester fibers are resistant to a wide range of solvents, enhancing their applicability in various industrial processes.<\/li><li><strong>Thermal Stability<\/strong>: Polyester fibers can operate effectively in temperatures up to approximately 130\u00b0C(266\u2109) .<\/li><li><strong>Moisture Resistance<\/strong>: Polyester fibers inherently repel water, making these filter bags effective in applications where moisture is present.<\/li><li><strong>Cleanability<\/strong>: Polyester filter bags can be cleaned and reused multiple times, reducing operational costs.<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><h4>Technical Advantages of\u00a0 Polyester Filter Bags in Filmedia\u00ae<\/h4><ul><li>To increase system filtration capacity by 50-150% as needed without major changes to the dust collectors.<\/li><li>System cleaning efficiency markedly increased with the effective increase of bag to bag distance.<\/li><li>Bag life extended due to significant reduction of fatigue damage to the bags due to bag to cage impact.<\/li><\/ul><p>\u00a0<\/p><h3>Post-treatment of Polyester Filter Bags<\/h3><p>For polyester filter bags, we can treat it with different post-processing according to different working conditions. There are mainly the following post-processing treatments:<br \/>1. Anti-Static (line type, cross line type, blend type).<br \/>2. Anti-Spark.<br \/>3. Water &amp; Oil Repellent.<br \/>4. Anti-Abrasion (Acrylic coating).<br \/>5. PTFE Membrane.<br \/>6. PTFE Impregnation.<\/p><h4>Shapes and Types<\/h4><p><strong>Polyester filter bags can be made into different shapes, which can be mainly divided into the following three types:<\/strong><br \/>1. Round type.<br \/>2. Flat type.<br \/>3. Star\/pleated type.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-ecb43f7 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"ecb43f7\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-57f9f53 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"57f9f53\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail3_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3799\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail3_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail3_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail3_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Round-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail3_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Round Type<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-e67d0e0 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"e67d0e0\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail4_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3800\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail4_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail4_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail4_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Flat-Type-Polyester-Filter-Bags-detail4_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Flat Type<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-1d819f4 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"1d819f4\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-caption\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"600\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-detail5_syy.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3801\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-detail5_syy.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-detail5_syy-300x300.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-detail5_syy-150x150.jpg 150w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Pleated-Filter-Bags-02-1-detail5_syy-100x100.jpg 100w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<figcaption class=\"widget-image-caption wp-caption-text\">Pleated Type<\/figcaption>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/figure>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-19e7102 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"19e7102\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<p><strong>According to different working principles, polyester filter bags can also be made into the following three types:<\/strong><br \/>1. Pulse jet filter bag.<br \/>2. Reverse air filter bag.<br \/>3. Shaker filter bag.<\/p><h3>Application of Polyester Filter Bags<\/h3><p>Because polyester filter bags have high tensile strength, chemical resistance, and the ability to operate at moderately high temperatures, they are versatile and reliable in a variety of industrial environments.<\/p><ul><li><strong>Cement and Asphalt Production<\/strong>: Helps in capturing dust and particulates emitted from kilns and dryers.<\/li><li><strong>Water Treatment<\/strong>: Utilized in municipal and industrial water treatment plants for removing contaminants from water.<\/li><li><strong>Chemical Processing<\/strong>: Used to filter liquids in chemical manufacturing processes, ensuring product purity and protecting equipment.<\/li><li><strong>Food and Beverage Industry<\/strong>: Applied in the production of beverages, syrups, and other consumables to filter out impurities and particulates.<\/li><li><strong>Air Filtration<\/strong>: Incorporated in heating, ventilation, and air conditioning systems to improve indoor air quality by trapping dust, pollen, and other airborne particles.<\/li><li><strong>Pharmaceutical Industry<\/strong>: Used to filter and collect fine powders during the production of pharmaceuticals, ensuring compliance with health and safety regulations.<\/li><li><strong>Air Purification<\/strong>: Helps maintain sterile conditions in production and packaging areas.<\/li><li><strong>Tailings Management<\/strong>: Employed to manage and treat slurry from mining operations.<\/li><li><strong>Agriculture<\/strong>: Used in grain elevators and processing plants to filter dust and fine particulates generated during handling and milling.<\/li><li><strong>Paint and Coatings Industry<\/strong>: Helps in collecting overspray and maintaining clean air within coating booths.<\/li><li><strong>Mixing and Blending<\/strong>: Ensures air quality during the mixing and blending of raw materials.<\/li><li><strong>Metalworking<\/strong>: Filters out welding fumes and metal particles as well as metal dust generated during grinding and polishing operations.<\/li><li><strong>Woodworking<\/strong>: Essential in woodworking shops to capture sawdust and wood particles, improving air quality and reducing fire hazards.<\/li><\/ul>\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4a69d96 e-flex e-con-boxed e-con e-child\" data-id=\"4a69d96\" data-element_type=\"container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"e-con-inner\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-33d1125 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"33d1125\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail6.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3802\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail6.jpg 600w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Kiln-Raw-Mill-Filtration-detail6-300x200.jpg 300w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 600px) 100vw, 600px\" \/>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-4988546 elementor-widget__width-initial elementor-widget elementor-widget-image\" data-id=\"4988546\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"image.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"750\" height=\"500\" src=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7.jpg\" class=\"attachment-large size-large wp-image-3803\" alt=\"\" srcset=\"https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7.jpg 750w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/filter.philitee.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/12\/Cement-plant-filtration-detail7-600x400.jpg 600w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 750px) 100vw, 750px\" 